        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n2 0 10\n1 3\n2 3 4\n1 3",
        "output": "YES\nNO",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest Case 1 : f(A)=(1⊕3)=2f(A) = (1 \\oplus 3) = 2f(A)=(1⊕3)=2. 222 lies between 000 and 101010, hence it is a Halloween array.\nTest Case 2 : f(A)=2f(A) = 2f(A)=2. 222 does not lie between 333 and 444."
